<title>USA: Koll group offers $19/shr for Santa Anita.</title>
<headline>Koll group offers $19/shr for Santa Anita.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>An investor group led by Donald Koll on Wedensday made a proposal to the Santa Anita Cos valued at $19 per share as an alternative to an earlier proposal made by Colony Investments II LP.</p>
<p>Koll Arcadia Investors LLC said its proposal includes an initial investment of $50 million, which it said is nearly four times the $12.7 million proposed by Colony.</p>
<p>It said it would also make subsequent commitments to invest additional capital of up to $150 million.</p>
</text>
